  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing of Greenhouse Gas (GHG) Emissions in the Industrial Sector through Pelletization Technology in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve and enable environments for the widespread deployment of the biogas technology through technology demonstration and partnership with private sector.  The project objectives cover to:  1. Promote private sector investment on demonstration of medium and large-scale biogas systems for waste water treatment and income generation;  2. Provide technical assistance to establish of information hub for technology dissemination and promotion;  3. Provide technical assistance to build capacity of local stakeholders both public and private to replicate the application of the technology.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEF - Global Environment Facility</narrative>
  </participating-org>
